	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01076" index="1076">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They brush against one another\nto build up electricity.\nTogether, they create dazzling</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01077" index="1077">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Troop members practice together\nuntil their movements match\nperfectly. Their synchronized</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01078" index="1078">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The thunder of its four fists\ncan be heard beyond the\nmountains. Villagers once</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01079" index="1079">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Its will to live is remarkably\nstrong. As its body begins to\nfreeze, it draws its flame deep</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01080" index="1080">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It basks on warm rocks along the\nslopes of volcanoes. As it\nmatures, it makes its home ever</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01081" index="1081">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Volcanic eruptions were once\nbelieved to be the result of two\nMAGMALISK fighting over</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01082" index="1082">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Only an EMBERNEWT whose flame\nsurvives being sealed in ice\nbecomes this Pokémon. It draws</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01083" index="1083">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Travelers once froze solid\nfollowing its glowing eyes\nthrough blizzards, believing</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01084" index="1084">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It loves to nap in shallow\npuddles. Its down soaks up so\nmuch water that it sometimes</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01085" index="1085">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It soaks its stone-like feathers\nin rivers before long flights.\nThe absorbed water binds their</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01086" index="1086">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ancient accounts describe a\nfour-winged shadow followed by a\nrain of falling stars. Buried</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01087" index="1087">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">showers of sparks that frighten\noff much larger Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01088" index="1088">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">strikes overwhelm foes with\npowerful electric shocks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01089" index="1089">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">believed that storms began\nwherever these Pokémon gathered\nto train.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01090" index="1090">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">inside to keep it burning.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01091" index="1091">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">closer to the crater.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01092" index="1092">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">territory deep beneath the\nmountain. Its every step leaves\na pool of bubbling lava behind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01093" index="1093">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">all warmth from the surrounding\nair to keep its inner flame\nalive.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01094" index="1094">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">them to be a distant hearth.\nWhere it rests, winter lingers\nlong after the surrounding snow</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01095" index="1095">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">wakes to find itself sitting on\ndry ground.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01096" index="1096">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">layers together, repairing\ncracks caused by wear.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0811_fakemon_01097" index="1097">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">settlements have been found\nbeneath the paths of its\nmigrations.</language>
	</row>
